      "section": "Sample nuclei",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Three crops of a human cell screen image (DNA stain), each its own OME-Zarr store, named after the sample in the sheet below. Pick a sample on the left: the viewer opens that store, and the cards and the table narrow to its nuclei. The condition labels are for the demo, and \"mitotic\" marks bright, compact nuclei: a heuristic, not a classifier.\n",
